<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Xeikon lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Xeikon lowered.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it downgraded Xeikon NV to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- No other information was available. Xeikon was trading off 3/8 to 6-3/8.</p>
</text>
